  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transitioning to a rainbow peace: LGBTI people building peace in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to the effective application of the gender approach in the implementation of the Peace Agreement (PA) by advancing processes of investigation and advocacy before the bodies created within the framework of transitional justice. The objective is to increase the participation of LGBTI people in the implementation of the PA by 1) recognition by JEP of bias-motivated violence against LGBTI people, 2) visibility of the resistance and reconciliation experience of LGBTI people and 3) qualified participation in peace councils of LGBTI leaders.</narrative>
  </description>
